body.description:
AURORA (Architecture Unveiling through RNA Omics and Routine Histology Analysis)

trained_models: Pretrained AURORA models for LUAD, KIRC and BRCA.

*.pth: model weight;
*.json: parameters for the AURORA model;
*.csv: supporting information (cell types, gene names and normalizing factors) used by *.json.


predictions_112um: Virtual spatial transcriptomics at 112 μm * 112 μm by AURORA of TCGA-LUAD, TCGA-KIRC, TCGA-BRCA and BRCA pre-chemotherapy (https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-021-04278-5)… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/AURORAData/AURORA_prediction.

